 {n:"The array A = ⟨4,1,3,2,16,9,10,14,8,7⟩ is laid out as a complete binary tree: index labels sit beside each circle, key values inside. Leaves (indices 6–10) are already trivially heaps, so work starts at ⌊n/2⌋ = 5 — panel (a).",
